n: work created by recording a series of still images, such as drawings, objects, or posed people; when played back, the static images combine to simulate motion, creating the impression of movement)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Moving image genre-form guide online, June 18, 2007", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n58664278819a44418f1a34a8f57c4666b12", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:n58664278819a44418f1a34a8f57c4666b13"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Television cartoon shows"}}, {"@id": "_:n58664278819a44418f1a34a8f57c4666b13", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Television cartoon shows"}}, {"@id": "_:n58664278819a44418f1a34a8f57c4666b15", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:n58664278819a44418f1a34a8f57c4666b16"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Cartoons (Television programs)"}}, {"@id": "_:n58664278819a44418f1a34a8f57c4666b16", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Cartoons (Television programs)"}}, {"@id": "_:n58664278819a44418f1a34a8f57c4666b18", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:n58664278819a44418f1a34a8f57c4666b19"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Scooby-Doo television programs"}}, {"@id": "_:n58664278819a44418f1a34a8f57c4666b19", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Scooby-Doo television programs"}}, {"@id": "_:n58664278819a44418f1a34a8f57c4666b21", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:n58664278819a44418f1a34a8f57c4666b22"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Pink Panther television programs"}}, {"@id": "_:n58664278819a44418f1a34a8f57c4666b22", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Pink Panther television programs"}}], "@id": "/authorities/genreForms/gf2011026050"}
{"@context": "http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/context.json", "@graph": [{"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/gf2011026051", "@type": ["madsrdf:Authority", "madsrdf:GenreForm"], "bflc:marcKey": "155  $aAnthology films", "identifiers:lccn": "gf2011026051", "madsrdf:adminMetadata": [{"@id": "_:ne74f4137d7f345e7b1c6088330daa822b1"}, {"@id": "_:ne74f4137d7f345e7b1c6088330daa822b2"}], "madsrdf:authoritativeLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Anthology films"}, "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:ne74f4137d7f345e7b1c6088330daa822b3"}]}, "madsrdf:exampleNote": "Note under [Compilation films]", "madsrdf:hasBroaderAuthority": {"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/gf2011026406"}, "madsrdf:hasSource": [{"@id": "_:ne74f4137d7f345e7b1c6088330daa822b5"}, {"@id": "_:ne74f4137d7f345e7b1c6088330daa822b6"}, {"@id": "_:ne74f4137d7f345e7b1c6088330daa822b7"}, {"@id": "_:ne74f4137d7f345e7b1c6088330daa822b8"}], "madsrdf:hasVariant": [{"@id": "_:ne74f4137d7f345e7b1c6088330daa822b9"}, {"@id": "_:ne74f4137d7f345e7b1c6088330daa822b12"}, {"@id": "_:ne74f4137d7f345e7b1c6088330daa822b15"}, {"@id": "_:ne74f4137d7f345e7b1c6088330daa822b18"}, {"@id": "_:ne74f4137d7f345e7b1c6088330daa822b21"}, {"@id": "_:ne74f4137d7f345e7b1c6088330daa822b24"}, {"@id": "_:ne74f4137d7f345e7b1c6088330daa822b27"}], "madsrdf:isMemberOfMADSCollection": {"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/collection_LCGFT_General"}, "madsrdf:isMemberOfMADSScheme": {"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms"}, "madsrdf:note": "Feature-length films made up of various episodes or stories that are usually connected by a theme, event, location or original author and often have a wrap-around tale. For films that are composed of pre-existing published or unpublished films, or portions thereof, see [Compilation films.]", "madsrdf:useFor": {"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2007025581"}}, {"@id": "_:ne74f4137d7f345e7b1c6088330daa822b1", "@type": "ri:RecordInfo", "ri:languageOfCataloging": {"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/iso639-2/eng"}, "ri:recordChangeDate": {"@type": "xsd:dateTime", "@value": "2016-02-17T09:44:40"}, "ri:recordContentSource": {"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/organizations/dlc"}, "ri:recordStatus": "revised"}, {"@id": "_:ne74f4137d7f345e7b1c6088330daa822b2", "@type": "ri:RecordInfo", "ri:languageOfCataloging": {"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/iso639-2/eng"}, "ri:recordChangeDate": {"@type": "xsd:dateTime", "@value": "2011-05-04T00:00:00"}, "ri:recordContentSource": {"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/organizations/dlc"}, "ri:recordStatus": "new"}, {"@id": "_:ne74f4137d7f345e7b1c6088330daa822b3", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Anthology films"}}, {"@id": "_:ne74f4137d7f345e7b1c6088330daa822b5", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "p. 28 (Anthologies: use for fictional series which do not utilize the same set of characters over and over, but rather, consist of a string of distinct and unconnected dramatic presentations, each with a different cast and a different set of characters)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Yee, Martha M. Moving image materials : genre terms, 1988:", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:ne74f4137d7f345e7b1c6088330daa822b6", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "p. 90 (Episode film: a film composed of different parts or episodes which are in fact different stories, usually connected by an overall theme and forming a feature-length film. The segments or shorts that form the episode film may be by the same director or by a number of directors, nationally produced or co-produced by different countries; aka anthology film, composite film, episodic film, multiple story film, omnibus film, portmanteau film, sketch film)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Lopez, D. Films by genre, 1993:", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:ne74f4137d7f345e7b1c6088330daa822b7", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(hdg.: Anthology films)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "LCSH, November 15, 2007", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:ne74f4137d7f345e7b1c6088330daa822b8", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(Anthology: most commonly a television series (although occasionally a feature), without continuing characters, often linked by host, genre, original source, or reappearing star. Also use for work containing multiple, diverse segments that cover a wide range of topics and genres)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Moving image genre-form guide online, November 15, 2007", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:ne74f4137d7f345e7b1c6088330daa822b9", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:ne74f4137d7f345e7b1c6088330daa822b10"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Sketch films"}}, {"@id": "_:ne74f4137d7f345e7b1c6088330daa822b10", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Sketch films"}}, {"@id": "_:ne74f4137d7f345e7b1c6088330daa822b12", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:ne74f4137d7f345e7b1c6088330daa822b13"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Anthologies (Motion pictures)"}}, {"@id": "_:ne74f4137d7f345e7b1c6088330daa822b13", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Anthologies (Motion pictures)"}}, {"@id": "_:ne74f4137d7f345e7b1c6088330daa822b15", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:ne74f4137d7f345e7b1c6088330daa822b16"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Portmanteau films"}}, {"@id": "_:ne74f4137d7f345e7b1c6088330daa822b16", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Portmanteau films"}}, {"@id": "_:ne74f4137d7f345e7b1c6088330daa822b18", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:ne74f4137d7f345e7b1c6088330daa822b19"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Composite films"}}, {"@id": "_:ne74f4137d7f345e7b1c6088330daa822b19", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Composite films"}}, {"@id": "_:ne74f4137d7f345e7b1c6088330daa822b21", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:ne74f4137d7f345e7b1c6088330daa822b22"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Episodic films"}}, {"@id": "_:ne74f4137d7f345e7b1c6088330daa822b22", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Episodic films"}}, {"@id": "_:ne74f4137d7f345e7b1c6088330daa822b24", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:ne74f4137d7f345e7b1c6088330daa822b25"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Omnibus films"}}, {"@id": "_:ne74f4137d7f345e7b1c6088330daa822b25", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Omnibus films"}}, {"@id": "_:ne74f4137d7f345e7b1c6088330daa822b27", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:ne74f4137d7f345e7b1c6088330daa822b28"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Episode films"}}, {"@id": "_:ne74f4137d7f345e7b1c6088330daa822b28", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Episode films"}}], "@id": "/authorities/genreForms/gf2011026051"}
