 films"}}, {"@id": "_:ne3ea57fc33b74a2495d5c7d508a6e723b5", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "p. 39 (Car-Chase Action Film, Car-Chase/Car-Smash Movie, Car-Chase Film, Car-Crash Film see Chase Film) p. 42 (Today, the chase is a very important addition in action and suspense pictures, and it has come once more to the fore in car-chase action films and in car-crash films. This latter variety may also be designated as car-chase/car-smash movies or crash-and-wreck films)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Lopez, D. Films by genre, c1993:", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:ne3ea57fc33b74a2495d5c7d508a6e723b6", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:ne3ea57fc33b74a2495d5c7d508a6e723b7"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Car-crash films"}}, {"@id": "_:ne3ea57fc33b74a2495d5c7d508a6e723b7", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Car-crash films"}}, {"@id": "_:ne3ea57fc33b74a2495d5c7d508a6e723b9", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:ne3ea57fc33b74a2495d5c7d508a6e723b10"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Crash-and-wreck films"}}, {"@id": "_:ne3ea57fc33b74a2495d5c7d508a6e723b10", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Crash-and-wreck films"}}], "@id": "/authorities/genreForms/gf2011026110"}
