 movie database, Jan. 29, 2009", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:naf7edcb7bfa84a0abc76a6290e055363b8", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(I clowns (also known as The Clowns) is a 1970 television film by Federico Fellini; it is a part-documentary, part fantasy)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Wikipedia, Jan. 29, 2009", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:naf7edcb7bfa84a0abc76a6290e055363b9", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:naf7edcb7bfa84a0abc76a6290e055363b10"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Documentary television programs, Mock"}}, {"@id": "_:naf7edcb7bfa84a0abc76a6290e055363b10", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Documentary television programs, Mock"}}, {"@id": "_:naf7edcb7bfa84a0abc76a6290e055363b12", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:naf7edcb7bfa84a0abc76a6290e055363b13"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Documentary television programs, Fictionalized"}}, {"@id": "_:naf7edcb7bfa84a0abc76a6290e055363b13", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Documentary television programs, Fictionalized"}}, {"@id": "_:naf7edcb7bfa84a0abc76a6290e055363b15", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:naf7edcb7bfa84a0abc76a6290e055363b16"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Quasi-documentary television programs"}}, {"@id": "_:naf7edcb7bfa84a0abc76a6290e055363b16", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Quasi-documentary television programs"}}, {"@id": "_:naf7edcb7bfa84a0abc76a6290e055363b18", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:naf7edcb7bfa8