ic Channel National Geographic Channel, also commercially abbreviated as Nat Geo, is a subscription television channel that airs non-fiction television programs produced by the National Geographic Society.)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "ShareTV website, Dec. 12, 2012:", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n019d7f5b03e541b992aea61fc8c4093cb6", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(nonfiction: USE Documentaries and factual works; use for films and programs which depict actual persons and/or events. Exclude frank historical re-creations, but do not attempt to judge the \"truth\" of the depiction in a film purporting to be factual or documentary in nature)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Yee, M. Moving image materials, 1988", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n019d7f5b03e541b992aea61fc8c4093cb7", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(non-fiction shows on television; non-fiction TV series; non-fiction television shows; non-fiction television programs; TV series in the non-fiction genre)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Best non-fiction TV shows, via Ranker website, Dec. 12, 2012", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n019d7f5b03e541b992aea61fc8c4093cb8", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:n019d7f5b03e541b992aea61fc8c4093cb9"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Non-fiction television programs"}}, {"@id": "_:n019d7f5b03e541b992aea61fc8c4093cb9", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Non-fiction television programs"}}], "@id": "/authorities/genreForms/gf2011026425"}
