rce", "madsrdf:citationSource": "Kaminsky, S. American film genres, c1985;Handbk. of Am. film genres, 1988", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "notfound"}, {"@id": "_:nbdbfd3be0b2246a9a1b56167ab06c87bb6", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(Prison drama: use for fictional genre films and programs which are set in prisons and focus on prisoners. Escape attempts often figure in the plot; BT Crime drama)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Moving image materials : genre terms, 1988", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}], "@id": "/authorities/genreForms/gf2011026463"}
