ual events, and features ordinary people instead of professional actors)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Wikipedia website, July 30, 2007:", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n277c455051604c3fa4b981f69ff2f18db11", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(hdg.: Reality television programs)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "LCSH, July 30, 2007:", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n277c455051604c3fa4b981f69ff2f18db12", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:n277c455051604c3fa4b981f69ff2f18db13"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Big Brother television programs"}}, {"@id": "_:n277c455051604c3fa4b981f69ff2f18db13", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Big Brother television programs"}}, {"@id": "_:n277c455051604c3fa4b981f69ff2f18db15", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:n277c455051604c3fa4b981f69ff2f18db16"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Reality shows (Television programs)"}}, {"@id": "_:n277c455051604c3fa4b981f69ff2f18db16", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Reality shows (Television programs)"}}, {"@id": "_:n277c455051604c3fa4b981f69ff2f18db18", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:n277c455051604c3fa4b981f69ff2f18db19"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Reality-based television programs"}}, {"@id": "_:n277c455051604c3fa4b981f69ff2f18db19", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Reality-based television programs"}}], "@id": "/authorities/genreForms/gf2011026522"}
