 "2019-06-17T08:47:08"}, "ri:recordContentSource": {"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/organizations/wau"}, "ri:recordStatus": "revised"}, {"@id": "_:n17eb78cd600741e3840f3173cb065f00b3", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Worm's-eye views"}}, {"@id": "_:n17eb78cd600741e3840f3173cb065f00b5", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(worm's-eye views. Refers to views having a viewpoint well below normal eye level, typically depicted as if seen from the surface of the earth or the floor, as if the viewer is lying down and looking straight up. The horizon for a worm's-eye view is usually placed very low or outside the picture. For architectural drawings in precise perspective, use \"worm's-eye perspectives.\" UF toad's-eye views)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Art & architecture thesaurus online, Apr. 20, 2018", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n17eb78cd600741e3840f3173cb065f00b6", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationSource": "Glossary of the mapping sciences, 1994.", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "notfound"}, {"@id": "_:n17eb78cd600741e3840f3173cb065f00b7", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(bird's eye view: 65,600,000 hits; toad's eye view: 1,220 hits)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Google, March 13, 2019:", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n17eb78cd600741e3840f3173cb065f00b8", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(Worm's-eye views. SN Views with a viewpoint well below normal eye level. UF Toad's-eye views. BT Views)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Thesaurus for graphic materials, via WWW, Apr. 20, 2018", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n17eb78cd600741e3840f3173cb065f00b9", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "glossary (Worm's-eye view. A perspective representation from a very low viewpoint. See also View.)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Descriptive cataloging of rare materials (cartographic), 2016:", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n17eb78cd600741e3840f3173cb065f00b10", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "glossary (worm's-eye view: Perspective representation from a very low viewpoint)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Cartographic materials, 2002, 2005 update, via Cataloger's desktop, Mar. 23, 2010:", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n17eb78cd600741e3840f3173cb065f00b11", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Views--Worm's-eye (perspective representation from a viewpoint well below normal eye level)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Form/genre for cartographic materials [draft of LC working group], 1996:", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}], "@id": "/authorities/genreForms/gf2011026744"}
