rdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(Concert programs. BT Programs)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "LCSH", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:nc8ba4a94069645b587353e6f60c92e6db6", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(titles: The Elmer Joseph Miller collection of concert and theater programs, 1872-1975; Collection of concert programs for performances by Dame Nellie Melba, 1902-1928; Collection of concert programmes collected by E.L. Bainton relating to his own concerts and compositions; Programs for musical performances given on the University of California, Berkeley, 1870- ; An analysis of the program notes of selected symphony orchestras; Concert programs 1974-80 : a collection of programs issued at various concerts in Sydney, Pullman, U.S.A., and elsewhere, with program notes)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "OCLC, June 26, 2014", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:nc8ba4a94069645b587353e6f60c92e6db7", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:nc8ba4a94069645b587353e6f60c92e6db8"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Music concert programs"}}, {"@id": "_:nc8ba4a94069645b587353e6f60c92e6db8", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Music concert programs"}}], "@id": "/authorities/genreForms/gf2014026065"}
{"@context": "http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/context.json", "@graph": [{"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/gf2014026066", "@type": ["madsrdf:Authority", "madsrdf:GenreForm"], "bflc:marcKey": "155  $aConcordances", "identifiers:lccn": "gf2014026066", "madsrdf:adminMetadata": [{"@id": "_:n14b48fabe8004b25b57cbdb67f771fdcb1"}, {"@id": "_:n14b48fabe8004b25b57cbdb67f771fdcb2"}], "madsrdf:authoritativeLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Concordances"}, "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:n14b48fabe8004b25b57cbdb67f771fdcb3"}]}, "madsrdf:hasBroaderAuthority": {"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/gf2014026112"}, "madsrdf:hasSource": [{"@id": "_:n14b48fabe8004b25b57cbdb67f771fdcb5"}, {"@id": "_:n14b48fabe8004b25b57cbdb67f771fdcb6"}, {"@id": "_:n14b48fabe8004b25b57cbdb67f771fdcb7"}, {"@id": "_:n14b48fabe8004b25b57cbdb67f771fdcb8"}], "madsrdf:hasVariant": {"@id": "_:n14b48fabe8004b25b57cbdb67f771fdcb9"}, "madsrdf:isMemberOfMADSCollection": {"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/collection_LCGFT_General"}, "madsrdf:isMemberOfMADSScheme": {"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms"}, "madsrdf:note": "Alphabetical indexes of the words in a work or selection of works, showing the words' locations and providing context."}, {"@id": "_:n14b48fabe8004b25b57cbdb67f771fdcb1", "@type": "ri:RecordInfo", "ri:languageOfCataloging": {"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/iso639-2/eng"}, "ri:recordChangeDate": {"@type": "xsd:dateTime", "@value": "2015-12-07T16:19:54"}, "ri:recordContentSource": {"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/organizations/dlc"}, "ri:recordStatus": "revised"}, {"@id": "_:n14b48fabe8004b25b57cbdb67f771fdcb2", "@type": "ri:RecordInfo", "ri:languageOfCataloging": {"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/iso639-2/eng"}, "ri:recordChangeDate": {"@type": "xsd:dateTime", "@value": "2014-12-01T00:00:00"}, "ri:recordContentSource": {"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/organizations/ilchalcs"}, "ri:recordStatus": "new"}, {"@id": "_:n14b48fabe8004b25b57cbdb67f771fdcb3", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Concordances"}}, {"@id": "_:n14b48fabe8004b25b57cbdb67f771fdcb5", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(Concordances. BT Wordbooks)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Genre terms : a thesaurus for use in rare book and special collections cataloging, via WWW, July 26 2014", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n14b48fabe8004b25b57cbdb67f771fdcb6", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(concordance: An alphabetically arranged index of the principal words or selected words in a text, or in the works of an author, giving the precise location of each word in the text, with a brief indication of its context. A glossarial concordance includes a brief definition of each term. Concordances are usually devoted to very well known works, such as the Bible, or to the works of major writers (Chaucer, Shakespeare, etc.).)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Reitz, J.M. ODLIS : online dictionary for library and information science, July 26, 2014", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n14b48fabe8004b25b57cbdb67f771fdcb7", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "p. 35 (concordance)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "G\u00f6rlach, M. An alphabetical list of English text types, in Text types and the history of English, c2004:", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n14b48fabe8004b25b57cbdb67f771fdcb8", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(concordances. Includes indexes to the location of words or phrases in a text and finding aids, in two columns, establishing the relationship between the past and present reference numbers of individual items.)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Art & architecture thesaurus online, July 26, 2014", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n14b48fabe8004b25b57cbdb67f771fdcb9", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:n14b48fabe8004b25b57cbdb67f771fdcb10"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Glossarial concordances"}}, {"@id": "_:n14b48fabe8004b25b57cbdb67f771fdcb10", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Glossarial concordances"}}], "@id": "/authorities/genreForms/gf2014026066"}
