little books; Blow books; Books of hours; Brand books; Caricatures; Cartoons; Catchpenny prints; Coloring books; Comic books; Cries; Cruise book; Dance of death; Drawing books; Emblem books; Flip books; Herbals; Livres d'artistes; Metamorphic pictures; Painted books; Pattern books; Picture novels; Posters; Toy books; Viewbooks)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Genre terms : a thesaurus for use in rare book and special collections cataloging, via WWW, Aug. 5, 2014", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n66a79a3eea8940f38e8ae8ac8312de42b6", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(illustrated books. Books that include visual images to explain, augment, or embellish the text)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Art & architecture thesaurus online, Aug. 5, 2014", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n66a79a3eea8940f38e8ae8ac8312de42b7", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:n66a79a3eea8940f38e8ae8ac8312de42b8"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Pictorial works"}}, {"@id": "_:n66a79a3eea8940f38e8ae8ac8312de42b8", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Pictorial works"}}], "@id": "/authorities/genreForms/gf2014026111"}
