oranda, notes, postcards, e-mail, and other written and addressed messages exchanged between two or more people, usually archived with the personal papers of the correspondents. Often used in preparing biographical and historical works, correspondence may be published separately or with other papers)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Reitz, J.M. ODLIS : online dictionary for library and information science, July 28, 2014", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n4cc69d9aaa5d4218a9d0d2d6ce27e782b9", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:n4cc69d9aaa5d4218a9d0d2d6ce27e782b10"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Letters, Personal"}}, {"@id": "_:n4cc69d9aaa5d4218a9d0d2d6ce27e782b10", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Letters, Personal"}}, {"@id": "_:n4cc69d9aaa5d4218a9d0d2d6ce27e782b12", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:n4cc69d9aaa5d4218a9d0d2d6ce27e782b13"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Private email"}}, {"@id": "_:n4cc69d9aaa5d4218a9d0d2d6ce27e782b13", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Private email"}}, {"@id": "_:n4cc69d9aaa5d4218a9d0d2d6ce27e782b15", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:n4cc69d9aaa5d4218a9d0d2d6ce27e782b16"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Correspondence, Private"}}, {"@id": "_:n4cc69d9aaa5d4218a9d0d2d6ce27e782b16", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Correspondence, Private"}}, {"@id": "_:n4cc69d9aaa5d4218a9d0d2d6ce27e782b18", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:n4cc69d9aaa5d4218a9d0d2d6ce27e782b19"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Email, P