ets save the day : press 'n' play musical storybook, 2009.", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n164ea4e9a4cd4e628c8cf88c63184a63b9", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationSource": "Watt, F. Baby's very first touchy-feely musical play book, 2014.", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n164ea4e9a4cd4e628c8cf88c63184a63b10", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationSource": "Scheffler, A. Axel Scheffler's noisy jungle : a counting sound book, 2014.", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n164ea4e9a4cd4e628c8cf88c63184a63b11", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "cover (\"Play-a-Song\")"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "McKee, D. Happy day songs : pop-up songbook, c2003:", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n164ea4e9a4cd4e628c8cf88c63184a63b12", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "cover (\"15 scenes with true-to-life vehicle sounds\")"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Grossblatt, B. Vehicles : stereobook, 2009:", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n164ea4e9a4cd4e628c8cf88c63184a63b13", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "cover (\"Play-a-Song\")"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Moo, K. Baby Einstein playtime music box, c2006:", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n164ea4e9a4cd4e628c8cf88c63184a63b14", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationSource": "My little noisy book of ducklings, c2008.", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n164ea4e9a4cd4e628c8cf88c63184a63b15", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationSource": "Wagner, V. Disney Mickey Mouse clubhouse : 3 book play-a-sound set, c2011.", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n164ea4e9a4cd4e628c8cf88c63184a63b16", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "back cover (\"With eight giggling sound buttons, children will love laughing along with the babies in this noisy book.\")"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Little giggles : laugh along with 8 noisy sounds, c2012:", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n164ea4e9a4cd4e628c8cf88c63184a63b17", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationSource": "My bilingual talking dictionary : Mandarin & English, 2005.", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n164ea4e9a4cd4e628c8cf88c63184a63b18", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationSource": "Baggott, S. Baby's very first noisy book, 2013.", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n164ea4e9a4cd4e628c8cf88c63184a63b19", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(under Interactive children's book: Many children's interactive books have been enhanced through the use of technology. The earliest examples of this were books that had sound effects--a bar on the side of the book that had buttons corresponding with pictures in the story. When the icon appeared in the story, the reader could press a button on the side to hear the sound effect. These are called \"sound books.\")"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Wikipedia, Aug. 13, 2014", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n164ea4e9a4cd4e628c8cf88c63184a63b20", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationSource": "Fireman Sam on call sound book!, 2013.", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n164ea4e9a4cd4e628c8cf88c63184a63b21", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationSource": "Wagner, V. Animal friends : play-a-sound, c2009.", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n164ea4e9a4cd4e628c8cf88c63184a63b22", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:n164ea4e9a4cd4e628c8cf88c63184a63b23"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Melody books"}}, {"@id": "_:n164ea4e9a4cd4e628c8cf88c63184a63b23", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Melody books"}}, {"@id": "_:n164ea4e9a4cd4e62