": "(Exquisite corpse books; Books containing leaves cut from foredge to gutter and/or spine, so that parts of a leaf can be turned to reveal different combinations of spreads)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Artists' Books Thesaurus online, August 17, 2021:", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n5a559512330c49c7b7aa85a0813dc1bfb12", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(Split-page books. BT Toy and movable books)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "LCSH", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n5a559512330c49c7b7aa85a0813dc1bfb13", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(\"A picture book on ghosts, with split pages so tops can be mixed and matched with bottoms.\")"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Bruce, J.B. Ghastly ghosts, 2008", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n5a559512330c49c7b7aa85a0813dc1bfb14", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:n5a559512330c49c7b7aa85a0813dc1bfb15"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Exquisite corpse books"}}, {"@id": "_:n5a559512330c49c7b7aa85a0813dc1bfb15", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Exquisite corpse books"}}, {"@id": "_:n5a559512330c49c7b7aa85a0813dc1bfb17", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:n5a559512330c49c7b7aa85a0813dc1bfb18"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Mix-and-match books"}}, {"@id": "_:n5a559512330c49c7b7aa85a0813dc1bfb18", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Mix-and-match books"}}], "@id": "/authorities/genreForms/gf2014026179"}
