y for use with a specific text. UF Discussion Guides; Instructor Manuals; Teacher Guides. BT Guides)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "ERIC thesaurus, via WWW, July 28, 2014", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n9d03da9311c54ee1a1e61a3cf46381e1b9", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationSource": "Genre terms : a thesaurus for use in rare book and special collections cataloging, via WWW, June 26, 2014;Art & architecture thesaurus, via WWW, June 26, 2014", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "notfound"}, {"@id": "_:n9d03da9311c54ee1a1e61a3cf46381e1b10", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(titles: Teacher's guide to accompany Fundamentals of Pascal; Teacher's guide to accompany Astronomy now; Teacher's guide to accompany Programming by design; Teacher's guide and resource book to accompany Life management; Activity and teacher's guide to accompany The THINK series; Teacher resource guide to accompany \"The fish trap of Duncan Lake\" (book) and \"Traditional fish traps\" (video); Teacher's resource guide to accompany Second year Latin; Teacher's resource guide to accompany Fundamentals of modern drafting; Teacher's resource guide : Calculus, eighth edition, Larson, Hostetler, Edwards; Teacher's manual to accompany Legal research, a practical guide and self-instructional workbook, fourth edition; Teacher's handbook to accompany Chemistry in action; Teacher's handbook to accompany Gano's Commercial law; Farm management guide : --a complete reference of farming information : teacher manual, to accompany 16th edition guide; A teacher manual for use with Jackson Junior High, a film series for grades five through eight on alcohol education; Teacher's manual to accompany An introduction to criminal law, second edition; A teaching guide and manual for instrumental music in the secondary school; A teaching guide and solutions to An introduction to probability; Teaching guide and resource manual to accompany the sixth edition of M