ccompaniments (Music)"}}], "@id": "/authorities/genreForms/gf2014026617"}
{"@context": "http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/context.json", "@graph": [{"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/gf2014026618", "@type": ["madsrdf:Authority", "madsrdf:GenreForm"], "bflc:marcKey": "155  $aAdvent music", "identifiers:lccn": "gf2014026618", "madsrdf:adminMetadata": [{"@id": "_:n331d7bc1cb3346498298f04ef251fe27b1"}, {"@id": "_:n331d7bc1cb3346498298f04ef251fe27b2"}], "madsrdf:authoritativeLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Advent music"}, "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:n331d7bc1cb3346498298f04ef251fe27b3"}]}, "madsrdf:hasBroaderAuthority": [{"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/gf2014026795"}, {"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/gf2014027062"}], "madsrdf:hasSource": {"@id": "_:n331d7bc1cb3346498298f04ef251fe27b5"}, "madsrdf:isMemberOfMADSCollection": {"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/collection_LCGFT_General"}, "madsrdf:isMemberOfMADSScheme": {"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms"}, "madsrdf:note": "Music that is traditionally associated with Advent."}, {"@id": "_:n331d7bc1cb3346498298f04ef251fe27b1", "@type": "ri:RecordInfo", "ri:languageOfCataloging": {"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/iso639-2/eng"}, "ri:recordChangeDate": {"@type": "xsd:dateTime", "@value": "2014-12-10T00:00:00"}, "ri:recordContentSource": {"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/organizations/castsmf"}, "ri:recordStatus": "new"}, {"@id": "_:n331d7bc1cb3346498298f04ef251fe27b2", "@type": "ri:RecordInfo", "ri:languageOfCataloging": {"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/iso639-2/eng"}, "ri:recordChangeDate": {"@type": "xsd:dateTime", "@value": "2015-12-07T17:51:55"}, "ri:recordContentSource": {"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/organizations/dlc"}, "ri:recordStatus": "revised"}, {"@id": "_:n331d7bc1cb3346498298f04ef251fe27b3", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Advent music"}}, {"@id": "_:n331d7bc1cb3346498298f04ef251fe27b5", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(Advent; a season observed in many Western Christian churches as a time of expectant waiting and preparation for the celebration of the Nativity of Jesus at Christmas; many churches hold special musical events, such as Nine lessons and carols and singing of Handel's Messiah oratorio; the Advent prose, an antiphonal plainsong, may be sung; antiphons for the Magnificat at Vespers; Advent hymn O come, o come, Emmanuel; German songs for Advent)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Wikipedia, viewed August 8, 2014", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}], "@id": "/authorities/genreForms/gf2014026618"}
{"@context": "http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/context.json", "@graph": [{"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/gf2014026619", "@type": ["madsrdf:Authority", "madsrdf:GenreForm"], "bflc:marcKey": "155  $aAgbadja modern (Music)", "identifiers:lccn": "gf2014026619", "madsrdf:adminMetadata": [{"@id": "_:n81813c8a68d0491683af37f39990f5adb1"}, {"@id": "_:n81813c8a68d0491683af37f39990f5adb2"}], "madsrdf:authoritativeLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Agbadja modern (Music)"}, "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:n81813c8a68d0491683af37f39990f5adb3"}]}, "madsrdf:hasBroaderAuthority": {"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/gf2014027009"}, "madsrdf:hasSource": {"@id": "_:n81813c8a68d0491683af37f39990f5adb5"}, "madsrdf:isMemberOfMADSCollection": {"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/collection_LCGFT_General"}, "madsrdf:isMemberOfMADSScheme": {"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms"}}, {"@id": "_:n81813c8a68d0491683af37f39990f5adb1", "@type": "ri:RecordInfo", "ri:languageOfCataloging": {"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/iso639-2/eng"}, "ri:recordChangeDate": {"@type": "xsd:dateTime", "@value": "2014-12-10T00:00:00"}, "ri:recordContentSource": {"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/organizations/castsmf"}, "ri:recordStatus": "new"}, {"@id": "_:n81813c8a68d0491683af37f39990f5adb2", "@type": "ri:RecordInfo", "ri:languageOfCataloging": {"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/iso639-2/eng"}, "ri:recordChangeDate": {"@type": "xsd:dateTime", "@value": "2015-02-13T13:06:49"}, "ri:recordContentSource": {"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/organizations/dlc"}, "ri:recordStatus": "revised"}, {"@id": "_:n81813c8a68d0491683af37f39990f5adb3", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Agbadja modern (Music)"}}, {"@id": "_:n81813c8a68d0491683af37f39990f5adb5", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "booklet (Agbadja is a popular rhythm in Benin, Togo and Ghana, based on three differently toned percussion instruments and originally played during burial ceremonies. Gnonnas adapted and modernized it during the mid 60s and coined the term Agbadja Modern. It quickly became his trademark and he was dubbed \"Le Roi du Rhythme Agbadja\" (The King of the Agbadja Rhythm). The track Dadja Von O Von Non, recorded in 1966, was Gnonnas' first modern rendition of Agbadja)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Work cat.: Legends of Benin [SR] p2009:", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}], "@id": "/authorities/genreForms/gf2014026619"}
{"@context": "http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/context.json", "@graph": [{"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/gf2014026620", "@type": ["madsrdf:Authority", "madsrdf:GenreForm"], "bflc:marcKey": "155  $aAirs de cour", "identifiers:lccn": "gf2014026620", "madsrdf:adminMetadata": [{"@id": "_:n9a98f8ae97c54dbdb832d5b59c171ec7b1"}, {"@id": "_:n9a98f8ae97c54dbdb832d5b59c171ec7b2"}], "madsrdf:authoritativeLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Airs de cour"}, "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:n9a98f8ae97c54dbdb832d5b59c171ec7b3"}]}, "madsrdf:hasBroaderAuthority": {"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/gf2014027103"}, "madsrdf:hasSource": [{"@id": "_:n9a98f8ae97c54dbdb832d5b59c171ec7b5"}, {"@id": "_:n9a98f8ae97c54dbdb832d5b59c171ec7b6"}, {"@id": "_:n9a98f8ae97c54dbdb832d5b59c171ec7b7"}, {"@id": "_:n9a98f8ae97c54dbdb832d5b59c171ec7b8"}], "madsrdf:hasVariant": [{"@id": "_:n9a98f8ae97c54dbdb832d5b59c171ec7b9"}, {"@id": "_:n9a98f8ae97c54dbdb832d5b59c171ec7b12"}], "madsrdf:isMemberOfMADSCollection": {"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/collection_LCGFT_General"}, "madsrdf:isMemberOfMADSScheme": {"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms"}, "madsrdf:note": "French secular songs composed between 1571 and 1660 for voice and lute or for 4-8 unaccompanied voices."}, {"@id": "_:n9a98f8ae97c54dbdb832d5b59c171ec7b1", "@type": "ri:RecordInfo", "ri:languageOfCataloging": {"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/iso639-2/eng"}, "ri:recordChangeDate": {"@type": "xsd:dateTime", "@value": "2015-12-07T17:52:11"}, "ri:recordContentSource": {"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/organizations/dlc"}, "ri:recordStatus": "revised"}, {"@id": "_:n9a98f8ae97c54dbdb832d5b59c171ec7b2", "@type": "ri:RecordInfo", "ri:languageOfCataloging": {"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/iso639-2/eng"}, "ri:recordChangeDate": {"@type": "xsd:dateTime", "@value": "2014-12-10T00:00:00"}, "ri:recordContentSource": {"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/organizations/castsmf"}, "ri:recordStatus": "new"}, {"@id": "_:n9a98f8ae97c54dbdb832d5b59c171ec7b3", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Airs de cour"}}, {"@id": "_:n9a98f8ae97c54dbdb832d5b59c171ec7b5", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "t.p. (Airs de court)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Work cat.: 95005010: Second livre d'airs ... 1995:", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n9a98f8ae97c54dbdb832d5b59c171ec7b6", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(Air de cour; a term used by French composers and publishers from 1571 to the 1650s to designate many secular, strophic songs sung at court; composed either for four or five unaccompanied voices or for one voice usually with lute accompaniment)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Grove music online, viewed August 8, 2014", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n9a98f8ae97c54dbdb832d5b59c171ec7b7", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(Air de cour)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "New Harvard dict.", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n9a98f8ae97c54dbdb832d5b59c171ec7b8", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(Air de cour. Airs de cour)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "New Grove", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n9a98f8ae97c54dbdb832d5b59c171ec7b9", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:n9a98f8ae97c54dbdb832d5b59c171ec7b10"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Airs de court"}}, {"@id": "_:n9a98f8ae97c54dbdb832d5b59c171ec7b10", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Airs de court"}}, {"@id": "_:n9a98f8ae97c54dbdb832d5b59c171ec7b12", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:n9a98f8ae