g only the parts for chorus, at least in those portions of the work in which the chorus sings, with the instrumental accompaniment either arranged for keyboard(s) or other chordal instrument(s) or omitted.)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "RDA toolkit online, viewed August 28, 2014", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}], "@id": "/authorities/genreForms/gf2014026715"}
