0101ph\u0101; devotional music genre; an apparently defining characteristic of d\u0101ph\u0101 seems to be its performance by a group of male singers, divided into two choruses of equal size that sing in alternation (that is, antiphonally))", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}], "@id": "/authorities/genreForms/gf2014026758"}
