ecial occasions, 2014", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n5a580258f8e9446aa279b7dddbac2d52b7", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "under Event (b. Of a speech, literary composition, religious service, etc.: produced on, or intended for, a special occasion. Of a speaker, writer, etc.: given to speaking, writing, etc., on or for special occasions)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "OED online, viewed May 30, 2014:", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n5a580258f8e9446aa279b7dddbac2d52b8", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "under Russian Federation. II, Traditional music. b, Calendar songs and \"calls\" (They are divided into genres, according to the association of the songs with the calendar)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Grove music online, April 26, 2023 :", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n5a580258f8e9446aa279b7dddbac2d52b9", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "under Pi\u00e8ce de circonstance (Pi\u00e8ce de circonstance (Fr.: 'Event piece') Term used in France for an Event work intended to celebrate state events, laud rulers' actions or arouse patriotism) under Negri, Giulio Santo Pietro de' (... his op. 5 includes an Event piece celebrating an event there)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Grove music online, viewed May 30, 2014:", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n5a580258f8e9446aa279b7dddbac2d52b10", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:n5a580258f8e9446aa279b7dddbac2d52b11"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Calendar music"}}, {"@id": "_:n5a580258f8e9446aa279b7dddbac2d52b11", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Calendar music"}}, {"@id": "_:n5a580258f8e9446aa279b7dddbac2d52b13", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elemen