 the Transfiguration music"}}, {"@id": "_:n192558029528497d97db41812181fdb5b5", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationSource": "Work cat.: Kovalevsky, M. Liturgie selon Saint Germain de Paris [SR] p1984 (les chants variables de l'office de la f\u00eate de la Transfiguration)", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}], "@id": "/authorities/genreForms/gf2014026802"}
