468ebb5", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationSource": "Web. 3.", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:nac9eab9dcad44f2291bafc1dc35468ebb6", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(Finale: designation often applied since the mid-18th cent. to the last movement of an instrumental composition in several movements or to the concluding, continuously composed, section of an act of an opera or piece of stage music)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "New Grove", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:nac9eab9dcad44f2291bafc1dc35468ebb7", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationSource": "New Harvard dict. mus.", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:nac9eab9dcad44f2291bafc1dc35468ebb8", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationSource": "Work cat.: 99184906: Moosbauer, B. Tonart und Form in den Finali der Sinfonien von Joseph Haydn zwischen 1766 und 1774, c1998.", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}], "@id": "/authorities/genreForms/gf2014026804"}
