26ccf00c4ebab858a36302335d7fb3", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Hand-clapping games"}}, {"@id": "_:n33d126ccf00c4ebab858a36302335d7fb5", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "p. 320 (Miss Mary Mack 796.1 (traditional hand-clapping and street rhymes))"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Children's Catalog, 16th ed.:", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n33d126ccf00c4ebab858a36302335d7fb6", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(Spoke to Peggy Coughlan, who checked several sources including Subject Guide to Children's Books in Print which mentions Clapping and Singing as an index term)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Phone call to Children's Literature Center, 9/2/94", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n33d126ccf00c4ebab858a36302335d7fb7", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(Hand-clapping rhymes (Clapping rhymes))"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Hennepin", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n33d126ccf00c4ebab858a36302335d7fb8", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationSource": "F+W Folklore", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "notfound"}, {"@id": "_:n33d126ccf00c4ebab858a36302335d7fb9", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationSource": "Work cat.: 94-24752: Bernstein, S. Hand clap! 1994.", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n33d126ccf00c4ebab858a36302335d7fb10", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:n33d126ccf00c4ebab858a36302335d7fb11"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Clapping games"}}, {"@id": "_:n33d126ccf00c4ebab858a36302335d7fb11", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Clapping games"}}, {"@id": "_:n33d126ccf00c4ebab858a36302335d7fb13", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:ele