 music for any single voice or instrument in an ensemble)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Harvard dictionary of music, 4th ed.", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n1add3e405aa04ed3be06ba3b684f428bb6", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(Part. In the context of notated music, a component consisting of the music for the use of one or more, but not all, performers.)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "RDA toolkit online, viewed August 28, 2014", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}], "@id": "/authorities/genreForms/gf2014026986"}
