, June 27, 2001.", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n79adc3f632ef452694163fe4ebf09963b6", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationSource": "Work cat.: 2001336490: Reichel, Bernard. Concertino pour piano et orchestre, 1992.", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}], "@id": "/authorities/genreForms/gf2014027051"}
