 3.a. A special form of procedure or characteristic set of procedures employed (more or less systematically) in an intellectual discipline or field of study as a mode of investigation and inquiry, or of teaching and exposition.)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "OED online, viewed August 27, 2014", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n9b51649e568f4c248d6832380d826c76b6", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(Method (Music). In music, a method is a kind of textbook for a specified musical instrument or a selected problem of playing a certain instrument.)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Wikipedia, viewed August 27, 2014", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}], "@id": "/authorities/genreForms/gf2014027209"}
