v/authorities/genreForms"}, "madsrdf:note": "Systematically arranged descriptions of materials held by libraries, regardless of catalog format (e.g., card catalogs, book catalogs)."}, {"@id": "_:n353c43aaa12840689f160faf94802abdb1", "@type": "ri:RecordInfo", "ri:languageOfCataloging": {"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/iso639-2/eng"}, "ri:recordChangeDate": {"@type": "xsd:dateTime", "@value": "2015-01-06T00:00:00"}, "ri:recordContentSource": {"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/organizations/wau"}, "ri:recordStatus": "new"}, {"@id": "_:n353c43aaa12840689f160faf94802abdb2", "@type": "ri:RecordInfo", "ri:languageOfCataloging": {"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/iso639-2/eng"}, "ri:recordChangeDate": {"@type": "xsd:dateTime", "@value": "2016-12-13T15:12:16"}, "ri:recordContentSource": {"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/organizations/dlc"}, "ri:recordStatus": "revised"}, {"@id": "_:n353c43aaa12840689f160faf94802abdb3", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Library catalogs"}}, {"@id": "_:n353c43aaa12840689f160faf94802abdb5", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationSource": "University of Chicago. Far Eastern Library. Classified catalog and subject index of the Chinese and Japanese collections, 1973.", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n353c43aaa12840689f160faf94802abdb6", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationSource": "Washington State Energy Office. Library. Energy matters : video and film catalog, 1992.", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n353c43aaa12840689f160faf94802abdb7", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationSource": "NOAA Central Library. NOAA Central Library catalog of CD-ROM holdings, 1993.", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n353c43aaa12840689f160faf94802abdb8", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationSource": "National Library (Bhutan). Catalogue of collections of the National Library of Bhutan (English section), 2005.", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n353c43aaa12840689f160faf94802abdb9", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationSource": "Baker Library. Subject catalog of the Baker Library, Graduate School of Business Administration, Harvard University, 1971.", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n353c43aaa12840689f160faf94802abdb10", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(Library catalogs. NT Author catalogs; Book catalogs; Card catalogs; Classified catalogs; Classified catalogs (Dewey decimal); Classified catalogs (Universal decimal); Dictionary catalogs; Divided catalogs; Imprint catalogs (Library materials); Online library catalogs; Sheaf catalogs; Subject catalogs; Union catalogs)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "LCSH, Jan. 6, 2015", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n353c43aaa12840689f160faf94802abdb11", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationSource": "National Agricultural Library (U.S.). Dictionary catalog of the National Agricultural Library, 1862-1965, 1967-1970.", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n353c43aaa12840689f160faf94802abdb12", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationSource": "American Museum of Natural History. Library. Research catalog of the Library of the American Museum of Natural History, 1978.", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n353c43aaa12840689f160faf94802abdb13", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(Catalogue. A list of books, maps, or other items, arranged in some definite order. It records, describes and indexes (usually completely) the resources of a collection, a library or a group of libraries. To be distinguished from (1) a list, which may or may not be in any particular order and may be incomplete, and (2) a bibliography, which may not be confined to any one collection of books or to a particular group of libraries.)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Harrod, L.M. The librarians' glossary of terms used in librarianship ... 1971", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n353c43aaa12840689f160faf94802abdb14", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationSource": "Work cat.: British Library. Catalogue of the Jain manuscripts of the British Library, 2006.", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n353c43aaa12840689f160faf94802abdb15", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationSource": "Smithsonian Institution. Libraries. National Museum of African Art Branch. Catalog of the Library of the National Museum of African Art Branch of the Smithsonian Institution Libraries, 1991.", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n353c43aaa12840689f160faf94802abdb16", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "catalog (1. A file of bibliographic records, created according to specific and uniform principles of construction and under the control of an authority file, which describes the materials contained in a collection, library, or group of libraries. 2. In a wider sense, a list of materials prepared for a particular purpose, e.g., an exhibition catalog, a sales catalog.) classed catalog (A catalog arranged by subject according to a systematic scheme of classification. Also called Class catalog, Classified catalog, Systematic catalog, Classified subject catalog, and Catalogue raisonn\u00e9) dictionary catalog (A catalog in which all the entries (author, title, subject, series, etc.) and their related references are arranged together in one general alphabet) sheaf catalog (A catalog made up of sets of slips of a standard size (most typical is 7 3/4 x 4 inches) fastened together in a loose-leaf binder; used at one time, chiefly in British libraries. Synonymous with loose-leaf catalogs)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "The ALA glossary of library and information science, 1983:", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n353c43aaa12840689f160faf94802abdb17", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(Library catalogs. BT Catalogs; Reference works)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Genre terms : a thesaurus for use in rare book and special collections cataloging, via WWW, Jan. 6, 2015", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n353c43aaa12840689f160faf94802abdb18", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationSource": "King's College London. Library. Sheaf catalogue of Marsden Collection in King's College, London, 1943-1985?", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n353c43aaa12840689f160faf94802abdb19", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationSource": "International Museum of Photography at George Eastman House. Library. Library catalog of the International Museum of Photography at George Eastman House, 1982.", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n353c43aaa12840689f160faf94802abdb20", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:n353c43aaa12840689f160faf94802abdb21"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Classed catalogs"}}, {"@id": "_:n353c43aaa12840689f160faf94802abdb21", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Classed catalogs"}}, {"@id": "_:n353c43aaa12840689f160faf94802abdb23", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:n353c43aaa12840689f160faf94802abdb24"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Classified catalogs"}}, {"@id": "_:n353c43aaa12840689f160faf94802abdb24", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Classified catalogs"}}, {"@id": "_:n353c43aaa12840689f160faf94802abdb26", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:n353c43aaa12840689f160faf94802abdb27"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Subject catalogs (Library catalogs)"}}, {"@id": "_:n353c43aaa12840689f160faf94802abdb27", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Subject catalogs (Library catalogs)"}}, {"@id": "_:n353c43aaa12840689f160faf94802abdb29", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:n353c43aaa12840689f160faf94802abdb30"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Dictionary catalogs (Library catalogs)"}}, {"@id": "_:n353c43aaa12840689f160faf94802abdb30", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Dictionary catalogs (Library catalogs)"}}, {"@id": "_:n353c43aaa12840689f160faf94802abdb32", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:n353c43aaa12840689f160faf94802abdb33"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Class catalogs (Library catalogs)"}}, {"@id": "_:n353c43aaa12840689f160faf94802abdb33", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Class catalogs (Library catalogs)"}}], "@id": "/authorities/genreForms/gf2015026003"}
