ordinal (1a: a book containing directions for Roman Catholic services every day in the year; 1b: a collection of forms to be used in the Anglican Communion in the consecration of bishops and the ordination of priests and deacons) sacramentary (an early service book of the Western church known in many specific forms and containing typically the celebrant's part of the mass together with prayers for baptisms, ordinations, blessings, and consecrations)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Merriam Webster online, June 2, 2015:", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n16be6a107b6645e2b2d68bacc968a5a4b7", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "benedictional (A book containing the forms of episcopal benedictions formerly in use)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "OED online, Sept. 8, 2015:", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n16be6a107b6645e2b2d68bacc968a5a4b8", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:n16be6a107b6645e2b2d68bacc968a5a4b9"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Sacramentaries"}}, {"@id": "_:n16be6a107b6645e2b2d68bacc968a5a4b9", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Sacramentaries"}}, {"@id": "_:n16be6a107b6645e2b2d68bacc968a5a4b11", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:n16be6a107b6645e2b2d68bacc968a5a4b12"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Responses (Liturgies)"}}, {"@id": "_:n16be6a107b6645e2b2d68bacc968a5a4b12", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Responses (Liturgies)"}}, {"@id": "_:n16be6a107b6645e2b2d68bacc968a5a4b14", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:n16be6a107b6645e2b2d68bacc968a5a4b15"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Altar books"}}, {"@id": "_:n