te public awareness of consumer goods or social issues. BT Advertisements)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Thesaurus for graphic materials, via WWW, Feb. 24, 2017", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:nd710b57e677046b7be4188dd5cf4874bb7", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationSource": "Brown, W.E. Souvenirs of Miami, Florida : 100 years of promotional literature, 1896-1996, 1996.", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:nd710b57e677046b7be4188dd5cf4874bb8", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "p. 4 of cover (Published by the Eastern Carolina Chamber of Commerce)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Eastern North Carolina, where prosperity is perennial, invites you!, 1924?:", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:nd710b57e677046b7be4188dd5cf4874bb9", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(promotional booklet for Vancouver, Washington published by Vancouver Chamber of Commerce; 1st subj. hdg.: City promotion--Washington (State)--Vancouver)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Work cat.: Right now is the time to learn about Vancouver, Washington, 1935", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:nd710b57e677046b7be4188dd5cf4874bb10", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(promotional materials. UF promotional objects. BT information artifacts. Scope note: Printed matter or objects devised to advertise or promote products, causes, or other concerns, especially those items given away to prospective consumers, clients, or contributors. Not used with reference to items produced before the late 19th century)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Art & architecture thesaurus online, Feb. 24, 2017", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:nd710b57e677046b7be4188dd5cf4874bb11", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:nd710b57e677046b7be4188dd5cf4874bb12"}]}, "madsrdf:var