"2017-08-14T11:52:29"}, "ri:recordContentSource": {"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/organizations/dlc"}, "ri:recordStatus": "revised"}, {"@id": "_:n2ec61aaa54e14be3a817fb78cef00ca4b3", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Travel posters"}}, {"@id": "_:n2ec61aaa54e14be3a817fb78cef00ca4b5", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationSource": "Alsop, P. Selling the dream : classic New Zealand tourism posters, 2016.", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n2ec61aaa54e14be3a817fb78cef00ca4b6", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(Travel posters. UF Tourism--Posters; Travel--Posters; Voyages and travels--Posters. BT Posters)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "LCSH, May 24, 2017", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n2ec61aaa54e14be3a817fb78cef00ca4b7", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationSource": "Ottaviani, L. Travel Italia : the golden age of Italian travel posters : posters from the Collection Alessandro Bellenda, Alassio, Italy, 2007.", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n2ec61aaa54e14be3a817fb78cef00ca4b8", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(1 portfolio with 15 folded sheets; 14 of the folded sheets consist of a poster reproduction)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Work cat.: Northern California travel posters 1896-1960, \u00a92007", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n2ec61aaa54e14be3a817fb78cef00ca4b9", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(Travel posters. SN Posters that promote general tourism or advertise travel opportunities. The means of transportation, such as railroads or ocean liners, are often depicted. UF Tourist trade posters; Transportation posters. BT Posters)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Thesaurus for graphic materials, via WWW, May 24, 2017", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n2ec61aaa54e14be3a817f