ing-of-age comics"}}, {"@id": "_:n7d63e5462b44488aa6d4fb789d4475f0b5", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(Bandes dessin\u00e9es d'\u00e9ducation. Equivalent: Coming-of-age comics)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "RVMGF, via WWW, Sept. 12, 2017", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n7d63e5462b44488aa6d4fb789d4475f0b6", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "t.p. (the graphic novel as a bildungsroman, a coming of age story--an old genre in the literary canon appearing in a new medium) p. 48 (A number of graphic novels may be included in the bildungsroman genre; the graphic novel bildungsroman; the coming of age graphic novel; bildungsroman graphic novels)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Schwarz, G. Old media, new media : the graphic novel as Bildungsroman, 2011, viewed online Sept. 12, 2017:", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n7d63e5462b44488aa6d4fb789d4475f0b7", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "p. 429 (In his 2012 comic My Friend Dahmer, Backderf explores the formative years of the man he knew as 'Jeff', using both the comics form and the genre of the Bildungsroman; the comic as Bildungsroman)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Journal of graphic novels and comics, June 2014:", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n7d63e5462b44488aa6d4fb789d4475f0b8", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(This One Summer, illustrated by Jillian Tamaki, written by Mariko Tamaki. Intricately detailed illustrations in shades of indigo are masterfully layered with the text in this graphic novel. The pacing and strong imagery evoke myriad emotions and ground this poignant and painfully realistic coming-of-age story.)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "2015 Caldecott Medal and Honor Books website, Sept. 12, 2017", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n7d63e5462b44488aa6d4fb789d4475f0b9", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(graphic novel telling a coming-of-age story)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Work cat.: Tamaki, Mariko. This one summer, 2014", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}], "@id": "/authorities/genreForms/gf2017026107"}
