ed by the use of skill and imagination, and possess an aesthetic that is valued and of a quality and type that would be collected by art museums. It may refer to the study or practice of the fine arts or the fine and decorative arts together.)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Art & architecture thesaurus online, August 14, 2016", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:nb05cdd8bf0424691a60a4ad5dc224ac2b7", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(Art; UF Art, Occidental; Art, Visual; Art, Western (Western countries); Arts, Fine; Arts, Visual; Fine arts; Iconography; Occidental art; Visual arts; Western art (Western countries); BT Arts; scope note: Here are entered general works on the visual arts. Works on the arts in general, including the visual arts, literature, and the performing arts, are entered under Arts)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "LCSH, August 14, 2016", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:nb05cdd8bf0424691a60a4ad5dc224ac2b8", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:nb05cdd8bf0424691a60a4ad5dc224ac2b9"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Artworks"}}, {"@id": "_:nb05cdd8bf0424691a60a4ad5dc224ac2b9", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Artworks"}}, {"@id": "_:nb05cdd8bf0424691a60a4ad5dc224ac2b11", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:nb05cdd8bf0424691a60a4ad5dc224ac2b12"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Works of art"}}, {"@id": "_:nb05cdd8bf0424691a60a4ad5dc224ac2b12", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Works of art"}}, {"@id": "_:nb05cdd8bf0424691a60a4ad5dc224ac2b14", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:nb05cdd8bf0424691a60a4ad5dc224ac2b15"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": 