uring ghosts)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Work cat.: Telgemeier, R. Ghosts, 2016", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n02eab9e6cc824094bf367ba617b4d8edb6", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(graphic novels; summary: After a tragic encounter with an artifact known as \"The Dreamstone,\" infamous treasure hunter Fabian Gray was possessed by five literary ghosts and has been granted access to their unique abilities.)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Barbiere, F.J. Five ghosts, 2013-", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}], "@id": "/authorities/genreForms/gf2018026038"}
