 for protected areas in the tropics; Terrestrial wildlife inventories)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "OCLC, Apr. 26, 2018", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:nf7050c9aee3f45f4ad95c16eb1c8f3beb7", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "contents (Aquatic insects / Graham Brown -- Fishes / Helen K. Larson -- Vertebrate fauna of terrestrial habitats adjoining freshwater ecosystems / Paul Horner and Tony Griffiths)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Work cat.: Wildlife survey in freshwater ecosystems and adjoining terrestrial habitats on Melville Island, Northern Territory, October 1996, \u00a91998:", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:nf7050c9aee3f45f4ad95c16eb1c8f3beb8", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(Zoological surveys. UF Animal inventories; Animal surveys; Fauna inventories; Fauna surveys; Faunal inventories; Faunal surveys; Wildlife inventories; Wildlife surveys; Zoological inventories; Zoology surveys. BT Ecological surveys; Zoology--Methodology)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "LCSH, Apr. 26, 2018", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:nf7050c9aee3f45f4ad95c16eb1c8f3beb9", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "p. 5 (survey of the Keep River aquatic fauna, with emphasis on fishes; carried out from 5-11 October, 1998) Appendix 1 (Bird species recorded in Keep River/Sandy Creek area, October 1998) Appendix 2 (Amphibian, reptile, and mammal species recorded in Keep River/Sandy Creek area, October 1998)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Work cat.: Larson, H.K. Keep River aquatic fauna survey, \u00a91999:", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:nf7050c9aee3f45f4ad95c16eb1c8f3beb10", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:nf7050c9aee3f45f4ad95c16eb1c8f3beb11"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Surveys, Animal"}}, {"@id": "_