019-02-21T10:27:35"}, "ri:recordContentSource": {"@id": "http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/organizations/dlc"}, "ri:recordStatus": "revised"}, {"@id": "_:n1a31b4c2f1fe47cc80d4222af0bffc53b3", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Fashion competition shows (Television programs)"}}, {"@id": "_:n1a31b4c2f1fe47cc80d4222af0bffc53b5", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(Project Runway, the Heidi Klum-hosted fashion/design competition show)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Adweek, v. 50, issue 16 (4/20/2009), via EBSCOhost, viewed on May 7, 2018", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n1a31b4c2f1fe47cc80d4222af0bffc53b6", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "p. 445 (the reality fashion competition show)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Lamb, C.W. Essentials of marketing, \u00a92012, via Google books, viewed May 7, 2018:", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n1a31b4c2f1fe47cc80d4222af0bffc53b7", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(24 hour catwalk, a new reality design competition; fashion-competition shows)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Ginsberg, M. Another reality designer competition show, '24 hour catwalk,' debuts on Lifetime, via The Hollywood reporter website, posted Jan. 10, 2012, viewed on Oct. 18, 2018", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n1a31b4c2f1fe47cc80d4222af0bffc53b8", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(Project Runway is an American reality television series that focuses on fashion design. The contestants compete with each other to create the best clothes and are restricted by time, materials and theme; the show won a Peabody Award in 2008 \"for using the 'television reality contest' genre to engage, inform, enlighten and entertain\")"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Wikipedia, May 7, 2018", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n1a31b4c2f1fe47cc80d4222af0bffc53b9", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "v. 3, p. 234 (the fashion competition show Project Runway)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "LoBrutto, V. TV in the USA, 2018, via Google books, viewed May 7, 2018:", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n1a31b4c2f1fe47cc80d4222af0bffc53b10", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(television series follows twelve young fashion designers competing with each other to make it in the high-stakes world of fashion)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Work cat.: Project runway (Television program). Season 1. Project runway. The complete first season, \u00a92004", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n1a31b4c2f1fe47cc80d4222af0bffc53b11", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(\"Between Project Runway, NBC's upcoming Fashion Star, and 24 Hour Catwalk, you'd think we'd have enough fashion reality TV show competitions to go around\")"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Rihanna to produce and star in new fashion competition reality TV show, via Fashionista website, Jan. 26, 2012, viewed on May 7, 2018", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n1a31b4c2f1fe47cc80d4222af0bffc53b12", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:n1a31b4c2f1fe47cc80d4222af0bffc53b13"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Fashion reality television programs"}}, {"@id": "_:n1a31b4c2f1fe47cc80d4222af0bffc53b13", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Fashion reality television programs"}}, {"@id": "_:n1a31b4c2f1fe47cc80d4222af0bffc53b15", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:n1a31b4c2f1fe47cc80d4222af0bffc53b16"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Reality fashion competition shows (Television programs)"}}, {"@id": "_:n1a31b4c2f1fe47cc80d4222af0bffc53b16", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Reality fashion competition shows (Television programs)"}}], "@id": "/authorities/genreForms/gf2018026056"}
