ceremony to mark the adulthood of girls, called bat mitzvah)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Britannica online, Aug. 1, 2018", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n227859747faa446d866e3812eb67d9b0b10", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationSource": "Glazer, Simon. The bar-mitzvah pulpit : sermonettes for bar-mitzvah boys and others, \u00a91928.", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n227859747faa446d866e3812eb67d9b0b11", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(\"When [Gabe Knopf] celebrated his barmitzvah at Pinner synagogue, he was presented with a rap written by the shul's Rabbi Danny Bergson. ... The speech was originally written in traditional sermon form, but after remembering that Gabe was into rap, it was quickly transformed.\")"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Paul, Rachel. A rapping rabbi's barmitzvah sermon!, via Jewish news website, posted July 6, 2015, viewed Aug. 1, 2018", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n227859747faa446d866e3812eb67d9b0b12", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:n227859747faa446d866e3812eb67d9b0b13"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Bar mitzwa sermons"}}, {"@id": "_:n227859747faa446d866e3812eb67d9b0b13", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Bar mitzwa sermons"}}, {"@id": "_:n227859747faa446d866e3812eb67d9b0b15", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:n227859747faa446d866e3812eb67d9b0b16"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Bar mitzva sermons"}}, {"@id": "_:n227859747faa446d866e3812eb67d9b0b16", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Bar mitzva sermons"}}, {"@id": "_:n227859747faa446d866e3812eb67d9b0b18", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@