"@language": "en", "@value": "(letter to the editor: A letter, usually printed at the discretion of the publisher on the editorial page of a newspaper or magazine, in which a reader expresses his or her views on the subject of a previously published article or editorial, or on the editorial policy of the publication in general, sometimes followed by a brief response from the editor(s).)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Reitz, J.M. ODLIS : online dictionary for library and information science, Oct. 12, 2018", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n20232569f9314163b6e5f8476a5bb6b4b12", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationSource": "Feed back : letters to the editor of the Times of India, \u00a91988.", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n20232569f9314163b6e5f8476a5bb6b4b13", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationSource": "Raghavendra Rao, B. A chronicle of letters : written to various newspapers from 1976 to 2013, 2014.", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n20232569f9314163b6e5f8476a5bb6b4b14", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(letters to the editor. Letters written to a newspaper or magazine to present a position, make a correction, or respond to another story or letter.)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Art & architecture thesaurus online, Oct. 12, 2018", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:n20232569f9314163b6e5f8476a5bb6b4b15", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:n20232569f9314163b6e5f8476a5bb6b4b16"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Letters to the press"}}, {"@id": "_:n20232569f9314163b6e5f8476a5bb6b4b16", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Letters to the press"}}, {"@id": "_:n20232569f9314163b6e5f8476a5bb6b4b18", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:n20232569f9314163b6