ttp://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/organizations/dlc"}, "ri:recordStatus": "revised"}, {"@id": "_:nd55650bba2c1411eb35b5842c1577c0cb3", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Yom Kippur fiction"}}, {"@id": "_:nd55650bba2c1411eb35b5842c1577c0cb5", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationSource": "Sabbag, G. Shira at the temple : a Yom Kippur story, 2013.", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:nd55650bba2c1411eb35b5842c1577c0cb6", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(stories about Yom Kippur, the holiest day on the Jewish calendar)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Yom Kippur stories, via Chabad.org website, July 15, 2019", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:nd55650bba2c1411eb35b5842c1577c0cb7", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationSource": "Work cat.: Cohen, B. Yussel's prayer : a Yom Kippur story, \u00a91981.", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:nd55650bba2c1411eb35b5842c1577c0cb8", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(Many stories feature Yom Kippur; Yom Kippur fiction, especially short stories; \"Kagan's Superfecta\" by Allen Hoffman; \"A Yom Kippur Scandal\" by Sholem Aleichem; \"Yom Kippur: The Day Without Forgiveness\" by Elie Wiesel; \"North Light: A Recollection in the Present Tense\" by Mark Helprin; \"We Have Trespassed\" by Elisa Albert; \"And Also Much Cattle\" by Allegra Goodman; \"The Art Biz\" by Allegra Goodman; \"The Day of Atonement\" by Samson Raphaelson; \"Twofold\" by S.Y. Agnon)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Bresler, K. Yom Kippur fiction roundup, via JewishBoston website, posted Sept. 8, 2017, viewed on July 15, 2019", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:nd55650bba2c1411eb35b5842c1577c0cb9", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(Yom Kippur. UF Atonement, Day of; Day of Atonement (Jewish holiday); Jewish Day of Atonement; Yom ha-Kippurim. BT High Holidays)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "LCSH, July 15, 2019", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:nd55650bba2c1411eb35b5842c1577c0cb10", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationNote": {"@language": "en", "@value": "(collection of six stories, in which the Cohen children prepare for Rosh Hashanah and Yom Kippur)"}, "madsrdf:citationSource": "Fu\u1e33s, M. Stories about Rosh Hashanah and Yom Kippur, 2000", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:nd55650bba2c1411eb35b5842c1577c0cb11", "@type": "madsrdf:Source", "madsrdf:citationSource": "Kimmelman, L. Sound the shofar! : a story for Rosh Hashanah and Yom Kippur, \u00a91998.", "madsrdf:citationStatus": "found"}, {"@id": "_:nd55650bba2c1411eb35b5842c1577c0cb12", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:nd55650bba2c1411eb35b5842c1577c0cb13"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Yom ha-Kippurim fiction"}}, {"@id": "_:nd55650bba2c1411eb35b5842c1577c0cb13", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Yom ha-Kippurim fiction"}}, {"@id": "_:nd55650bba2c1411eb35b5842c1577c0cb15", "@type": ["madsrdf:GenreForm", "madsrdf:Variant"], "madsrdf:elementList": {"@list": [{"@id": "_:nd55650bba2c1411eb35b5842c1577c0cb16"}]}, "madsrdf:variantLabel": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Day of Atonement fiction"}}, {"@id": "_:nd55650bba2c1411eb35b5842c1577c0cb16", "@type": "madsrdf:GenreFormElement", "madsrdf:elementValue": {"@language": "en", "@value": "Day of Atonement fiction"}}], "@id": "/authorities/genreForms/gf2019026110"}
